`mix setup` downloads the checksum-pinned x86_64 QEMU image to a versioned file
here. `config/simulator.exs` resolves the default from the workspace tooling;
updating that dependency and running setup selects its new pin. Existing managed
images are checksum-verified. Corrupt images are reported, never overwritten.

To use custom firmware, set an explicit path in `config/simulator.exs` and provide
that file yourself. Custom images and older versions are preserved. This folder
contains firmware artifacts, not platform source code.
